Daśaratha revives and summons Sumantra --- Daśaratha asks where Rāma eats sleeps dwells --- Daśaratha asks what Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sītā said --- Sumantra reports Rāma bows to father feet --- Rāma sends health to queens and Kausalyā --- Rāma bids Bharata honor mothers and father king --- Tearful Rāma weeps delivering message --- Angry Lakṣmaṇa denies fatherhood and condemns exile --- Silent Sītā weeps watching departing chariot --- Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sītā stand gazing at chariot